Depends: bash, libc6 (>= 2.35), libstdc++6 (>= 12), libgcc-s1, zlib1g, libfontconfig1, libgl1, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libx11-6, libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1-0, libpangoft2-1.0-0, libdbus-1-3, libwayland-server0, libwayland-client0, ca-certificates
Recommends: libgl1-mesa-dri, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav, shared-mime-info, desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Slicing software for 3D printing
 Bambu Studio is a feature-rich 3D printing slicer. This package repackages
 the official Ubuntu 22.04 Linux AppImage as a native Debian package,
 including its resources, desktop launcher and bundled libraries.
